          </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Comfort & Fit</strong></td>
          <td>Stiff sole, thin padding, runs small</td>
          <td>Comfortable insoles, correct padding, true-to-size (TTS)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Stitching & Glue</strong></td>
